                                    <div class="post-content">
                                        <h3 class="post-title">
                                            <a href="#">Donations Maintenance</a>
                                        </h3>
                                        <p class="post-description">
                                            Exciting update in our donation system! Now, it's
                                            possible to award points to users for each donation they
                                            make. This encourages more donations and fosters a sense
                                            of community and reward among users.
                                        </p>
                                        <span class="post-date"
                                        ><i class="fa fa-clock-o"></i>Apr 11, 2024</span
